# Workstation-management docs (this root). The code lives in
# NIS16-ESP32-Environment-semi-final/, which has its own .gitignore.
# Only personal / generated files are ignored here so the anchor docs get committed.

# NOTE: .gitignore does NOT support trailing comments. A comment placed after a
# pattern becomes part of the pattern, so it silently matches nothing. That bug
# is how CLAUDE.local.md and .env ended up unignored here (fixed sep. 22, 2026).
# Keep every comment on its own line.

# personal overrides — never share
CLAUDE.local.md
# secrets
.env
*.log

# Editor / OS junk
.obsidian/workspace.json
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Python / build artifacts if any tooling runs from here
__pycache__/
*.pyc
